  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.07,
      "end_seconds": 7.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Right then, come on in. Okay, what would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.09,
      "end_seconds": 16.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "so the thing is, I've got a scratchy throat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.46,
      "end_seconds": 22.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.92,
      "end_seconds": 31.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "It's alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.16,
      "end_seconds": 32.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.75,
      "end_seconds": 39.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "I'm, I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.74,
      "end_seconds": 42.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.98,
      "end_seconds": 50.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "For three weeks, I'd say. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.87,
      "end_seconds": 60.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.6,
      "end_seconds": 76.47,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "Well, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. Only warm drinks, and it's not much. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.8,
      "end_seconds": 92.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any fever, shortness of breath, chest pain or ear pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.43,
      "end_seconds": 99.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "No, um, no fever, shortness of breath, chest pain or ear pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.93,
      "end_seconds": 104.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.18,
      "end_seconds": 106.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.06,
      "end_seconds": 111.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.15,
      "end_seconds": 134.0,
      "duration_seconds": 20.85,
      "text": "yes, thin bones. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I've, I've had high blood pressure for two years now. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I took the morning off to come in today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.77,
      "end_seconds": 145.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well. Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.62,
      "end_seconds": 153.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Just a cataract operation in my left eye, about a year ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.68,
      "end_seconds": 157.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.62,
      "end_seconds": 162.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.55,
      "end_seconds": 166.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.04,
      "end_seconds": 170.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.96,
      "end_seconds": 173.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.78,
      "end_seconds": 179.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.12,
      "end_seconds": 190.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.25,
      "end_seconds": 201.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.19,
      "end_seconds": 231.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 119 over 74, pulse is 82 beats a minute. And SpO2 97 percent on room air, temp 37.0 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.02,
      "end_seconds": 238.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "let me look at the the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.4,
      "end_seconds": 241.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.22,
      "end_seconds": 254.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Your throat is a little red and your chest is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.07,
      "end_seconds": 259.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.21,
      "end_seconds": 280.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this is probably a simple viral cold."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.08,
      "end_seconds": 283.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.3,
      "end_seconds": 291.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a simple viral cold"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.63,
      "end_seconds": 309.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "rest, plenty of fluids, and paracetamol if you ache anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.9,
      "end_seconds": 312.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.41,
      "end_seconds": 316.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}